<section class="phero"><div class="phero-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/capitol-plaza.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/capitol-plaza-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/capitol-plaza.webp 1200w" sizes="100vw" width="1200" height="608" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.08"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li aria-current="page">Privacy Policy</li></ol></nav><p class="eyebrow on-dark">Legal</p><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p class="lede">How Kentucky Insurance Appraiser collects, uses and protects information you share through this website, forms, calls and email.</p></div></section><div class="wrap cols"><article class="prose narrow">
<p><em>Last updated: November 12, 2026</em></p>
<h2>What we collect</h2><p>When you submit a form, call or email us, we collect what you choose to share — such as your name, phone number, email address, property location and details about your claim. Our web host also records standard technical data (IP address, browser type, pages requested) for security and performance.</p>
<h2>How we use it</h2><ul><li>To respond to your inquiry and evaluate your claim.</li><li>To provide services you ask for.</li><li>To keep the site secure and working.</li></ul>
<p>We don’t sell personal information. We share it only with people who need it to help with your claim (with your permission), with providers who host our site and email, or when the law requires it.</p>
<h2>Calculators</h2><p>Our calculators and checklists run entirely in your browser. What you type into them isn’t sent to us or stored on our servers.</p>
<h2>Cookies and analytics</h2><p>This site doesn’t use advertising cookies. Fonts load from Google Fonts, which may log standard request data under Google’s privacy policy. If we add an analytics tag, it will be used to understand site traffic in aggregate.</p>
<h2>Text messages</h2><p>If you agree to be contacted by text, message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to opt out at any time.</p>
<h2>Your choices</h2><p>Ask us to access, correct or delete what you’ve shared by emailing <a href="mailto:info@kentuckyinsuranceappraiser.com">info@kentuckyinsuranceappraiser.com</a>.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2><p>Kentucky Insurance Appraiser · <a href="tel:+18445371427">+1 (844) 537-1427</a> · <a href="mailto:info@kentuckyinsuranceappraiser.com">info@kentuckyinsuranceappraiser.com</a></p></article><aside class="side"><div class="side-in"><div class="box box-call"><h2 class="box-t">Free claim conversation</h2><p>Tell us what the carrier offered. We’ll say plainly whether appraisal fits.</p><a class="box-phone" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg>(844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn coral full" href="/contact-us/">Send claim details</a><small><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg> Mon–Fri 8am–6pm ET</small></div></div></aside></div>
